# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Several source files picked up CRLF from tooling on Windows, which made
# exact-match edits and (more seriously) left a UTF-8 BOM inside
# prisma/migrations/*.sql - PostgreSQL rejects a BOM as a syntax error.
# Checking the sources in as LF keeps one file per format in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
